    "text": "Minutes | Topics | Resolutions This page was last updated on 27 July 2026. For more recent meetings, see an alternative view of meeting minutes. 2022 8 March: ARIA-APG issue triage - no meeting next week (Mar 15) 2021 6 April: ARIA Authoring Practices Task Force Sliders - James Scholes will complie the slider ideas and disucssion details in the github issue. 26 January: ARIA Authoring Practices Task Force Meeting frequency, roadmap, and agenda planning - Jon will lead the focus group meeting for each APG example. 2019 1 October: ARIA Authoring Practice Guide Issue 1150 - support warning - Dorothy would work with Zoe to create PR to fix this CSS.",
